ad woman loses ₹10 lakh","summary":"","image":"","source":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/ahmedabad/free-movie-app-steals-upi-access-ahmedabad-woman-loses-10-lakh/articleshow/136232196.cms","published":"2026-11-28T03:25:00.000Z"},{"id":"zNjIzMjE3OC5jbXM","title":"Ahmedabad doctor accuses her husband, a US citizen, of dowry harassment","summary":"","image":"","source":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/ahmedabad/ahmedabad-doctor-accuses-her-husband-a-us-citizen-of-dowry-harassment/articleshow/136232178.cms","published":"2026-11-28T03:09:00.000Z"}]}